<title>UK: Marks &amp; Spencer up ahead of Xmas statement.</title>
<headline>Marks &amp; Spencer up ahead of Xmas statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK retailing group Marks &amp; Spencer Plc firmed on Tuesday ahead of the company's Christmas trading statement, due for release tomorrow morning.</p>
<p>By 1146 GMT, the shares were up 12p to 489 amid a generally softer retail sector.  </p>
<p>&quot;People are just flattening their books ahead of the statement, and it's squeezing a few (shorts) out of the market&quot; said one.</p>
<p>The statement is to include sales figures for the four months from September 30, 1996 to January 25, 1997.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
